स्मृ स्म॑रति स्म॑र˚ते pp. स्मृत (q.v.) remember (gen.
or acc.);
 recollect, call to mind;
 hand down, record, declare, teach
(esp. P. स्मर्यते be recorded or declared as a law or custom, pass for
(nom. or loc.). Caus. स्मारयति & स्मरयति cause to remember, remind
(2 acc. or gen. of pers. & acc. of th.). — अनु remember, collect;
confess. C. remind. अप lose conscience, forget. उप remember, call
to mind (acc.). प्र remember or forget. प्रति remember;
 C. remind.
वि forget;
 C. cause to forget (2 acc.). सम् remember (acc.);
 C.
remind of (2 acc.). — Cf. अनुस्मृत, विस्मृत, संस्मृत.

स्मृत a. remembered, handed down by memory or tradition,
taught, enjoined;
 passing for, named, called (nom. ±इति).

स्मृतिमन्त् a. having (a good) memory or (full)
conscience;
 versed in law.
